 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "workers lists distinct worker names; tasks lists [id, duration] pairs (distinct ids, positive durations) processed in the given order. A worker's workload is the sum of durations of tasks already given to that worker. Level 1: give each task to the worker with the smallest workload, ties to the lexicographically smallest name. Return, for each worker in input order, the ids of its tasks in assignment order.",
